lessons.lesson:
A `while` loop runs its body over and over as long as its condition is true. Be
sure something inside moves toward making the condition false, or it runs
forever.

```ts
let i = 1;
let sum = 0;
while (i <= 5) {
  sum = sum + i;
  i = i + 1;
}
console.log(sum);   // 15
```

